 è il più bello di tutti"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Red Shoes and the Seven Dwarfs","overview":"Princes who have been turned into Dwarfs seek the red shoes of a lady in order to break the spell, although it will not be easy.","tagline":"Your true self is the fairest of them all"},{"language":"ko-KR","overview":"사건 사고가 끊이지 않는 동화의 섬. 사라진 아빠를 찾던 화이트 왕국의 공주는 우연히 마법구두를 신고 이전과 완벽하게 다른 ‘레드슈즈’로 거듭난다. 한편, 초록색 난쟁이가 된 일곱 왕자들은 우연히 자신들의 집에 머물게 된 '레드슈즈’가 저주를 풀 유일한 희망이라 생각해 그녀를 돕기 시작하고, 영원한 아름다움을 꿈꾸는 왕비 ‘레지나’는 마법구두를 신고 성을 빠져나간 ‘레드슈즈’를 쫓기 시작하는데…","tagline":"위기에 빠진 동화의 섬, 레드슈즈, 그리고 일곱 왕자들의 운명은?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5V3UVsxlt4blPkVJxodunAiGtO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nN4Gs3vZAOJ1D6FRtrwbU9VGYwU.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":486589,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ko-KR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5V3UVsxlt4blPkVJxodunAiGtO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5V3UVsxlt4blPkVJxodunAiGtO.jpg","language":"it","width":1199,"height":1659},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5V3UVsxlt4blPkVJxodunAiGtO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5V3UVsxlt4blPkVJxodunAiGtO.jpg","language":"it","width":1199,"height":1659},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kqqwfXqfBm97hWpiEZPiJSw8uVV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kqqwfXqfBm97hWpiEZPiJSw8uVV.jpg","language":"it","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Rulamvj7lFUs1rZltwiUNG5hqt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Rulamvj7lFUs1rZltwiUNG5hqt.jpg","language":"it","width":1067,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/daPLEPt8U9MeBkLx7b4vGbQbj3A.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.